{"file": "tori.trades_260_178327v_DKFf2CqN3up.mp4", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.14, "text": "So, why am I still here 10 years later trading?", "words": [{"w": "So,", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.18}, {"w": "why", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.46}, {"w": "am", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.6}, {"w": "I", "start": 0.6, "end": 0.7}, {"w": "still", "start": 0.7, "end": 0.92}, {"w": "here", "start": 0.92, "end": 1.12}, {"w": "10", "start": 1.12, "end": 1.4}, {"w": "years", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.58}, {"w": "later", "start": 1.58, "end": 1.84}, {"w": "trading?", "start": 1.84, "end": 2.14}]}, {"start": 2.46, "end": 5.84, "text": "It is certainly not because price respects my trendlines every single time.", "words": [{"w": "It", "start": 2.46, "end": 2.56}, {"w": "is", "start": 2.56, "end": 2.78}, {"w": "certainly", "start": 2.78, "end": 3.2}, {"w": "not", "start": 3.2, "end": 3.48}, {"w": "because", "start": 3.48, "end": 3.72}, {"w": "price", "start": 3.72, "end": 4.0}, {"w": "respects", "start": 4.0, "end": 4.36}, {"w": "my", "start": 4.36, "end": 4.6}, {"w": "trendlines", "start": 4.6, "end": 5.02}, {"w": "every", "start": 5.02, "end": 5.34}, {"w": "single", "start": 5.34, "end": 5.58}, {"w": "time.", "start": 5.58, "end": 5.84}]}, {"start": 6.06, "end": 6.4, "text": "That's hilarious.", "words": [{"w": "That's", "start": 6.06, "end": 6.18}, {"w": "hilarious.", "start": 6.18, "end": 6.4}]}, {"start": 6.82, "end": 9.86, "text": "It's because I have trained myself to respect my own risk.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "start": 6.82, "end": 7.14}, {"w": "because", "start": 7.14, "end": 7.32}, {"w": "I", "start": 7.32, "end": 7.5}, {"w": "have", "start": 7.5, "end": 7.6}, {"w": "trained", "start": 7.6, "end": 7.88}, {"w": "myself", "start": 7.88, "end": 8.42}, {"w": "to", "start": 8.42, "end": 8.72}, {"w": "respect", "start": 8.72, "end": 9.08}, {"w": "my", "start": 9.08, "end": 9.38}, {"w": "own", "start": 9.38, "end": 9.54}, {"w": "risk.", "start": 9.54, "end": 9.86}]}